script:pre-request {
  if (["cli", "runner"].includes(req.getExecutionMode())) {
    bru.runner.skipRequest();
  }
}

docs {
  Placeholder for a future virtual courses endpoint.

  No virtual courses controller or public HTTP contract exists yet, so this
  request deliberately has no status assertions and is skipped by the
  collection runner. The `virtualCoursesUrl` variable is intentionally not
  defined. Configure it only after an endpoint contract is implemented.
}
